        ></path>
      </svg>
      <div class="text-lg font-bold text-cream">Mac</div>
      <div class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
        版本 0.4.8 · {MAC_SIZE}<br />
        Apple Silicon（M1 及以后）专用<br />
        建议 macOS 14 及以上
      </div>
      <a
        href={MAC_URL}
        class="mt-2 text-center text-sm font-medium px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-primary/90 !text-primary-foreground !no-underline hover:bg-primary transition-colors"
      >
        下载 macOS 版 0.4.8
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-2xl surface-glass p-6 flex flex-col gap-3">
      <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-cream" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
        <path
          d="M3 5.5 10.2 4.5v7.05H3V5.5Zm0 13 7.2 1V12.5H3v6ZM11.3 4.35 21 3v8.55h-9.7V4.35Zm0 8.15H21V21l-9.7-1.35V12.5Z"
        ></path>
      </svg>
      <div class="text-lg font-bold text-cream">Windows</div>
      <div class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
        版本 0.4.9 · {WIN_SIZE}<br />
        Windows 10 / 11（64 位）<br />
        安装到当前用户，通常无需管理员权限
      </div>
      <a
        href={WIN_URL}
        class="mt-2 text-center text-sm font-medium px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-primary/90 !text-primary-foreground !no-underline hover:bg-primary transition-colors"
